  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Public Sector Strengthening II (Fale)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Public Service Fale is a five-year Pacific public service strengthening programme, managed by a Wellington-based specialist team embedded in the New Zealand Public Service Commission. The programme works with Pacific Island countries to actively support public sector reform initiatives, develop Pacific-specific solutions and support Pacific Public Service Commissions to share knowledge and experience across the region.</narrative>
  </description>
